WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Discovery Lab: a simulated terrain-and-marble experiment, not a physical recording.

00:06.800 --> 00:12.354
Change gravity from 9.81 to 3.71 m/s², then sculpt the valley.

00:12.354 --> 00:17.381
Drop another marble into the hand-sculpted starting scene.

00:17.381 --> 00:27.583
Run the model: trajectories and live kinetic, potential and lost energy.

00:27.583 --> 00:34.189
Inspect the computed run from the same starting state.

00:34.189 --> 00:40.635
Record an independent server calculation, then replay its result hash.

00:40.635 --> 00:46.400
Save the investigation and export its evidence bundle.